Metric weights
==============

The content- and style-similarity metrics follow the evaluation setup from NeuralPreset:
https://github.com/ZHKKKe/NeuralPreset

Download the two metric weights from the repository root:

curl -L \
  https://github.com/ZHKKKe/NeuralPreset/raw/refs/heads/main/src/metric/content_similiary/ldc.pth \
  -o metrics/ldc.pth

curl -L \
  https://github.com/ZHKKKe/NeuralPreset/raw/refs/heads/main/src/metric/style_similiary/StyleSimiliaryDiscriminator.onnx \
  -o metrics/StyleSimiliaryDiscriminator.onnx

Expected layout:

metrics/
├── ldc.pth
└── StyleSimiliaryDiscriminator.onnx
